{"expires":1779742160337,"value":{"code":200,"headers":{"etag":"W/\"9QoUd8V14l\"","last-modified":"Mon, 25 May 2026 19:49:20 GMT","cache-control":"max-age=3600"},"body":{"title":"Deploying to Vercel","slug":"deployment-vercel","tags":["deployment","vercel"],"content":"# Deploying to Vercel\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nInstall the Vercel CLI:\n\n```bash\nnpm i -g vercel\n```\n\n## Deploy\n\n```bash\nvercel deploy --prod\n```\n\nVercel auto-detects Nuxt and sets the correct build command and output directory.\n\n## Custom Domain\n\nIn the Vercel dashboard go to **Settings → Domains** and add your domain.\nDNS propagation typically takes under 5 minutes with Vercel's nameservers.\n","body":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tag":"h1","props":{"id":"deploying-to-vercel"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Deploying to Vercel"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"h2","props":{"id":"prerequisites"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Prerequisites"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install the Vercel CLI:"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"pre","props":{"className":"language-bash","code":"npm i -g vercel\n","language":"bash","meta":"","style":"undefined"},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"code","props":{"__ignoreMap":""},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"npm i -g vercel\n"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"h2","props":{"id":"deploy"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Deploy"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"pre","props":{"className":"language-bash","code":"vercel deploy --prod\n","language":"bash","meta":"","style":"undefined"},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"code","props":{"__ignoreMap":""},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"vercel deploy --prod\n"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vercel auto-detects Nuxt and sets the correct build command and output directory."}]},{"type":"element","tag":"h2","props":{"id":"custom-domain"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Custom Domain"}]},{"type":"